<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρπηξ</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρπηξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηκος</span>, 
			Aeol.
		 and 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρπαξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱκος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sapling, young shoot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Parth.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1425
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Iamb.</u>
				1.215
			</span></i>, <u>Ap.</u>I; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρπακι βραδίνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					104
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				78
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> anything made
			of such shoots or trees, <i>goad</i> for driving cattle, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				468
			</span></i> ; <i>lance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				221
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			metaph., <i>scion, descendant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				215
			</span></i>. [Acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρπᾰκα</span> is f.
				l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.200
			</span></i>.]</div>
